     "text": "Grapefruit Is a tropical large citrus fruit related to the orange, lemon, and pomelo families with a flavor that can range from bittersweet to sour. One of the best varieties of grapefruit is Star Ruby, which is known for its darkest red inside pigmentation among all the grapefruit varieties.",
     "html": "<h3><span><b>Grapefruit</b><br/></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;\"><span> Is a tropical large citrus fruit related to the orange, lemon, and pomelo families with a flavor that can range from bittersweet to sour. One of the best varieties of grapefruit is Star Ruby, which is known for its darkest red inside pigmentation among all the grapefruit varieties.<br/></span></span></h3>"
